  "Software Details": "Dettagli del software",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Gestisci senza sforzo il menu del tuo ristorante con Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Mese",
  "/Year": "/Anno",
  "Buy Now": "Acquista ora",
  "View Live Demo": "Visualizza la demo dal vivo",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Offerte e Promozioni dinamiche",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Aumenta le tue vendite e attira più clienti con la nostra funzionalità di gestione delle offerte. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Disposizioni efficienti dei tavoli",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Ottimizza la tua sala da pranzo e semplifica le tue operazioni con la nostra funzione di disposizione dei tavoli. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Personalizzazione e aggiornamenti in tempo reale",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Personalizza il tuo menu per adattarlo all'identità unica del tuo ristorante con i nostri strumenti di creazione di attributi e categorie. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Maggiore coinvolgimento del cliente",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Porta il tuo servizio clienti a un livello superiore con i nostri strumenti di gestione dei clienti. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Aggiornamenti frontend in tempo reale",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Con Dash SaaS, tutte le modifiche apportate al menu, alle offerte o alla disposizione dei tavoli da pranzo sono immediatamente visibili sul front-end. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Perché scegliere moduli dedicati",
  "for your business?": "per la tua attività?",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Con Dash puoi gestire comodamente tutte le tue funzioni aziendali da un'unica posizione",
  "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Potenzia la tua forza lavoro con DASH",
